{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/4d6f8f6f8d218844a3fde2c6f5b2bac3.avif?t=1762504665\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 <strong>Forget the cozy holiday magic!</strong> Dive into a <strong>biting satire of corporate life</strong> disguised as a charming Virtual Reality (VR) Christmas tale. Enjoy the immersive power of VR in this unique Christmas story featuring colorful characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a little mouse who worked relentlessly to achieve a single goal: <strong>becoming somebody</strong>. Driven only by her ambition, she slowly became mean and arrogant, pushing everyone else away. Until one day, she accepted a job offer from the most prolific toymaker in the world: <strong>Santa Claus</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little mouse was about to find out that <strong>climbing the corporate ladder was not all that she had hoped it would be...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.poster.avif?t=1762504665\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.webm?t=1762504665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.mp4?t=1762504665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The sad story of the little mouse who wanted to become somebody</i> is a 28-minute narrative Virtual Reality experience. It's perfect for introducing people to Virtual Reality during the festive season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience has already won over audiences since its premiere at the Venice Film Festival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837890?t=1762504665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/d70160f926cd1409c1dc009439e6746567dddb7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762504665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/b154b74183b685f1f9aa0eb8ebc8cdaeb930d693/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762504665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/b154b74183b685f1f9aa0eb8ebc8cdaeb930d693/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762504665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/4d6f8f6f8d218844a3fde2c6f5b2bac3.avif?t=1762504665\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84 <strong>Forget the cozy holiday magic!</strong> Dive into a <strong>biting satire of corporate life</strong> disguised as a charming Virtual Reality (VR) Christmas tale. Enjoy the immersive power of VR in this unique Christmas story featuring colorful characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a little mouse who worked relentlessly to achieve a single goal: <strong>becoming somebody</strong>. Driven only by her ambition, she slowly became mean and arrogant, pushing everyone else away. Until one day, she accepted a job offer from the most prolific toymaker in the world: <strong>Santa Claus</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little mouse was about to find out that <strong>climbing the corporate ladder was not all that she had hoped it would be...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.poster.avif?t=1762504665\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.webm?t=1762504665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/extras/81e23ec8fe36616710fdf9de36c51ede.mp4?t=1762504665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The sad story of the little mouse who wanted to become somebody</i> is a 28-minute narrative Virtual Reality experience. It's perfect for introducing people to Virtual Reality during the festive season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience has already won over audiences since its premiere at the Venice Film Festival.</p>","developers":["Atlas V","Reynard Films","The Pack"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837890/8abb0660f7cf1ba4d4a1b22c009b1b736011a172/header.jpg?t=1762504665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837890/1858520273/a0ba7fd8210e669bd061b70db2cac4de0a550bf3/1760087670/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762504663","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.